			"height": 360,
			"text": "## chloe-keep\nstyle\n# Holds Chloe steady in edits: only the named part changes.\ntemplate: \"Keep the exact same person: same face, hair and clothes (Chloe Miller, social media manager and aspiring gothic novelist in her mid twenties, black bob with blunt bangs, dark lipstick, an oversized cardigan covered in pins). Keep the exact same framing, crop, camera position and pose, and the same flat, evenly lit chroma-key green screen background, lighting and camera quality. Only change {prompt}\"\n"
