			"width": 560,
			"height": 460,
			"text": "## chloe-at-desk\nedit\nstatus: done\nmodel: qwen-edit\nsize: 1024x1024\nseed: 31\nprompt: \"Show the same person, with the same face, hair and clothes, now seated behind a small 1970s Italian modern desk from her boss's retro furniture collection: a compact desk with a glossy cream-white lacquer top with rounded corners on polished chrome legs. On it: a laptop covered in horror film stickers, a black notebook, a small white mushroom-shaped space-age lamp. She sits in a dark brown leather and chrome Italian chair, looking up shyly at the camera. Straight-on front view, the camera square to the desk at seated eye level: the front edge of the desk is perfectly horizontal and parallel to the bottom of the picture, both ends of the desk at the same height, the desk top barely visible. The whole desk and chair fit in the frame with empty space on both sides. No green objects. Flat, evenly lit pure green screen background, no floor, no shadow, no walls.\"\n",
			"color": "4"
		},
